    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s008-1-3-3-design-goals",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "1.3.3. Design Goals",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s008-1-3-3-design-goals.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 1.3.3. Design Goals\n\nIn the creation of the C2PA architecture, it was important to establish some clear goals for the work to ensure that the technology was usable across a wide spectrum of hardware and software implementations worldwide and accessible to all. Those goals can be found in [Table 1, “C2PA Design Goals”](#design-goals).\n\n**Table 1. C2PA Design Goals**\n\n| Goal | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| Privacy | Enable users to control the privacy of their information, including consumption data and information recorded in provenance |\n| Responsibility | Ensure consumers can determine t",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "The design goals, listed in Table 1 so the technology works across hardware and software worldwide and is accessible to all: privacy (users control their information), responsibility (consumers can determine provenance), scalability (web-scale creation and validation), extensibility (others can add metadata and credentials without C2PA approval), interoperability, whole-workflow applicability (provenance kept from creation through publication), technology minimalism (rely on well-established techniques), security (trustworthy integrity and source, with expert review), content ubiquity (all common media types, including documents), flexible locality (online and offline), global universality, accessibility (e.g. WCAG), harms and misuse (avert harms, including to human rights and vulnerable groups), and evolving (continual review against these goals).",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-10-31"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s009-1-4-how-to-read-this-specification",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
