      "target": "../sections/s017-2-1-3-signer.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.1.3. Signer\n\nThe credential holder of a private key that is used to sign the [claim](#_claim). The [signer](#signer-definition) is identified by the subject of the credential.\n\n<a id=\"_manifest_consumer\"></a>",
