    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s031-2-3-1-assertion",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.3.1. Assertion",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s031-2-3-1-assertion.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.3.1. Assertion\n\nA data structure which represents a statement either made (or \"created\") by the [signer](#signer-definition) or simply gathered at claim generation-time, concerning the [asset](#_asset). This data is a part of the [C2PA Manifest](#_c2pa_manifest).\n\n<a id=\"_assertion_store\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines an assertion as a data structure representing a statement about the asset, either made by the signer or simply gathered when the claim is generated; it is part of the C2PA Manifest.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-10-31"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s032-2-3-2-assertion-store",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.3.2. Assertion store",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s032-2-3-2-assertion-store.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.3.2. Assertion store\n\nThe logical collection of [assertions](#_assertion) referenced by a [claim](#_claim) within a [C2PA Manifest](#_c2pa_manifest), stored together as a single construct. For the full structural description, see [Assertion Store](#assertion-store-arch).\n\n<a id=\"_claim\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines the assertion store as the logical collection of assertions that a claim references within a C2PA Manifest, stored together as one construct, and points to the Assertion Store section for its full structure.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-10-31"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s033-2-3-3-claim",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.3.3. Claim",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s033-2-3-3-claim.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.3.3. Claim\n\nA digitally signed and tamper-evident data structure that references a set of [assertions](#_assertion), concerning an [asset](#_asset), and the information necessary to represent the [content binding](#_content_binding). If any [assertions](#_assertion) were redacted, then a declaration to that effect is included. This data is a part of the [C2PA Manifest](#_c2pa_manifest).\n\n<a id=\"claim-signature-definition\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines a claim as a digitally signed, tamper-evident data structure that references a set of assertions about an asset and the information needed to represent the content binding, and that declares any redacted assertions; it is part of the C2PA Manifest.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-10-31"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s034-2-3-4-claim-signature",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.3.4. Claim signature",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s034-2-3-4-claim-signature.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.3.4. Claim signature\n\nThe digital signature on the [claim](#_claim) created using the private key owned by a [signer](#signer-definition). The [claim signature](#claim-signature-definition) is a part of the [C2PA Manifest](#_c2pa_manifest).\n\n<a id=\"_c2pa_manifest\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines the claim signature as the digital signature on the claim, made with the private key owned by a signer; it is part of the C2PA Manifest.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-10-31"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s035-2-3-5-c2pa-manifest",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.3.5. C2PA Manifest",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s035-2-3-5-c2pa-manifest.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.3.5. C2PA Manifest\n\nThe set of information about the _provenance_ of an [asset](#_asset) based on the combination of one or more [assertions](#_assertion) (including [content bindings](#_binding_to_content)), a single [claim](#_claim), and a [claim signature](#claim-signature-definition). A [C2PA Manifest](#_c2pa_manifest) is part of a [C2PA Manifest Store](#_c2pa_manifest_store).\n\n> **NOTE:**\n> A [C2PA Manifest](#_c2pa_manifest) can reference other [C2PA Manifests](#_c2pa_manifest).\n\n<a id=\"_c2pa_manifest_store\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines a C2PA Manifest as the set of provenance information about an asset formed by one or more assertions (including content bindings), a single claim and a claim signature; it is part of a C2PA Manifest Store. A note says a manifest can reference other manifests.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
