    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s036-2-3-6-c2pa-manifest-store",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.3.6. C2PA Manifest Store",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s036-2-3-6-c2pa-manifest-store.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.3.6. C2PA Manifest Store\n\nA collection of [C2PA Manifests](#_c2pa_manifest) that can either be embedded into an [asset](#_asset) or be external to its [asset](#_asset).\n\n<a id=\"_content_credential\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines a C2PA Manifest Store as a collection of C2PA Manifests that can be embedded in an asset or kept external to it.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-10-31"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s037-2-3-7-content-credential",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.3.7. Content Credential",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s037-2-3-7-content-credential.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.3.7. Content Credential\n\nThis is the preferred non-technical term for a [C2PA Manifest](#_c2pa_manifest). The [C2PA Manifest Store](#_c2pa_manifest_store) therefore represents the Content Credentials of an asset.\n\nContent Credentials also refers to the overall C2PA technology, and is therefore essentially treated as a plural noun. If a [C2PA Manifest](#_c2pa_manifest) is a Content Credential, then multiple [C2PA Manifest](#_c2pa_manifest) or the broader, universal concept is Content Credentials.\n\n<a id=\"_active_manifest\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines Content Credential as the preferred non-technical term for a C2PA Manifest, so an asset's manifest store represents its Content Credentials. The term also names the C2PA technology as a whole and is treated as a plural noun: one manifest is a Content Credential, while several manifests or the broader concept are Content Credentials.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-10-31"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s038-2-3-8-active-manifest",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.3.8. Active Manifest",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s038-2-3-8-active-manifest.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.3.8. Active Manifest\n\nThe last manifest in the list of [C2PA Manifests](#_c2pa_manifest) inside of a [C2PA Manifest Store](#_c2pa_manifest_store) which is the one with the set of [content bindings](#_content_binding) that are able to be validated. For the full structural description, see [Manifest Store](#_manifest_store).\n\n<a id=\"_provenance\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines the active manifest as the last manifest in a C2PA Manifest Store's list, the one whose content bindings can be validated, and points to the Manifest Store section for its full structure.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-10-31"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s039-2-3-9-provenance",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.3.9. Provenance",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s039-2-3-9-provenance.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.3.9. Provenance\n\nThe logical concept of understanding the history of an [asset](#_asset) and its interaction with [actors](#_actor) and other [assets](#_asset), as represented by the [provenance data](#_provenance_data).\n\n<a id=\"_provenance_data\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines provenance as the logical concept of understanding an asset's history and its interactions with actors and other assets, as represented by the provenance data.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-10-31"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s040-2-3-10-provenance-data",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.3.10. Provenance data",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s040-2-3-10-provenance-data.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.3.10. Provenance data\n\nThe set of [C2PA Manifests](#_c2pa_manifest) for an [asset](#_asset) and, in the case of a [composed asset](#_composed_asset), its [ingredients](#ingredient_assertion). For the full structural description, see [Manifests](#_manifests).\n\n> **NOTE:**\n> A [C2PA Manifest](#_c2pa_manifest) can reference other [C2PA Manifests](#_c2pa_manifest).\n\n<a id=\"_authenticity\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines provenance data as the set of C2PA Manifests for an asset and, for a composed asset, for its ingredients, and points to the Manifests section for its full structure. A note says a manifest can reference other manifests.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-10-31"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s041-2-3-11-authenticity",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.3.11. Authenticity",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s041-2-3-11-authenticity.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.3.11. Authenticity\n\nA property of [digital content](#_digital_content) comprising a set of facts (such as the [provenance data](#_provenance_data) and [hard bindings](#_hard_bindings)) that can be cryptographically verified as not having been tampered with.\n\n<a id=\"_content_binding\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines authenticity as a property of digital content comprising a set of facts, such as the provenance data and hard bindings, that can be cryptographically verified as not having been tampered with.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s042-2-3-12-content-binding",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.3.12. Content binding",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s042-2-3-12-content-binding.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.3.12. Content binding\n\nInformation that associates [digital content](#_digital_content) to a specific [C2PA Manifest](#_c2pa_manifest) associated with a specific [asset](#_asset), either as a [hard binding](#_hard_binding) or a [soft binding](#soft_binding_assertion). For the full structural description, see [Binding to Content](#_binding_to_content).\n\n<a id=\"_hard_binding\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines content binding as information that associates digital content to a specific C2PA Manifest associated with a specific asset, either as a hard binding or a soft binding; the full structural description is in the Binding to Content section.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s043-2-3-13-hard-binding",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.3.13. Hard binding",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s043-2-3-13-hard-binding.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.3.13. Hard binding\n\nOne or more cryptographic hashes that uniquely identifies either the entire [asset](#_asset) or a portion thereof.\n\n<a id=\"_soft_binding\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines a hard binding as one or more cryptographic hashes that uniquely identify either the entire asset or a portion of it.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s044-2-3-14-soft-binding",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.3.14. Soft binding",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s044-2-3-14-soft-binding.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.3.14. Soft binding\n\nA content identifier that is either (a) not statistically unique, such as a [fingerprint](#_fingerprint), or (b) embedded as an [invisible watermark](#_invisible_watermark) in the identified [digital content](#_digital_content).\n\n<a id=\"_trust_signals\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines a soft binding as a content identifier that is either not statistically unique, such as a fingerprint, or embedded as an invisible watermark in the identified digital content.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s045-2-3-15-trust-signals",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.3.15. Trust signals",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s045-2-3-15-trust-signals.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.3.15. Trust signals\n\nThe collection of information that can inform a [Manifest Consumer’s](#_manifest_consumer) judgment of the trustworthiness of an [asset](#_asset). These are in addition to the [signer](#signer-definition) upon which the fundamental trust model relies.\n\n<a id=\"_c2pa_trust_list\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines trust signals as the collection of information that can inform a Manifest Consumer's judgment of the trustworthiness of an asset, in addition to the signer on which the fundamental trust model relies.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s046-2-3-16-c2pa-trust-list",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.3.16. C2PA Trust List",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s046-2-3-16-c2pa-trust-list.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.3.16. C2PA Trust List\n\nA C2PA-managed list of X.509 certificate trust anchors that issue certificates to hardware & software [signers](#signer-definition) that use them to sign [claims](#_claim).\n\n<a id=\"_c2pa_tsa_trust_list\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines the C2PA Trust List as a C2PA-managed list of X.509 certificate trust anchors that issue certificates to hardware and software signers, who use them to sign claims.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s047-2-3-17-c2pa-tsa-trust-list",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.3.17. C2PA TSA Trust List",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s047-2-3-17-c2pa-tsa-trust-list.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.3.17. C2PA TSA Trust List\n\nA C2PA-managed list of X.509 certificate trust anchors that issue certificates to Time Stamping Authorities (TSAs).\n\n<a id=\"_additional_terms\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines the C2PA TSA Trust List as a C2PA-managed list of X.509 certificate trust anchors that issue certificates to Time Stamping Authorities (TSAs).",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s048-2-4-additional-terms",
