    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s049-2-4-1-durable-content-credential",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.4.1. Durable Content Credential",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s049-2-4-1-durable-content-credential.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.4.1. Durable Content Credential\n\nA Durable Content Credential is a Content Credential for which there exists one or more soft bindings that enable its discovery in a manifest repository.\n\n<a id=\"_fingerprint\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines a Durable Content Credential as a Content Credential for which one or more soft bindings exist that enable its discovery in a manifest repository.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s050-2-4-2-fingerprint",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.4.2. Fingerprint",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s050-2-4-2-fingerprint.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.4.2. Fingerprint\n\nA set of inherent properties computable from [digital content](#_digital_content) that identifies the content or near duplicates of it.\n\n**EXAMPLE:** An [asset](#_asset) can become separated from its [C2PA Manifest](#_c2pa_manifest) due to removal or corruption of [asset](#_asset) metadata. A [fingerprint](#_fingerprint) of the [digital content](#_digital_content) of the [asset](#_asset) could be used to search a database to recover the [asset](#_asset) with an intact [C2PA Manifest](#_c2pa_manifest).\n\n<a id=\"_invisible_watermark\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines a fingerprint as a set of inherent properties computable from digital content that identifies the content or near duplicates of it. An example notes that if an asset becomes separated from its C2PA Manifest through removal or corruption of its metadata, a fingerprint of its digital content could be used to search a database and recover the asset with an intact C2PA Manifest.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s051-2-4-3-invisible-watermark",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.4.3. Invisible Watermark",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s051-2-4-3-invisible-watermark.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.4.3. Invisible Watermark\n\nInformation incorporated in a substantially human imperceptible way into the [digital content](#_digital_content) of an [asset](#_asset) which can be used, for example, to uniquely identify the [asset](#_asset) or to store a reference to a [C2PA Manifest](#_c2pa_manifest).\n\n<a id=\"_visible_watermark\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines an invisible watermark as information incorporated in a substantially human-imperceptible way into the digital content of an asset, which can be used, for example, to uniquely identify the asset or to store a reference to a C2PA Manifest.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s052-2-4-4-visible-watermark",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.4.4. Visible Watermark",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s052-2-4-4-visible-watermark.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.4.4. Visible Watermark\n\nA perceptible component of the [digital content](#_digital_content) carrying some human consumable information about the provenance of the [asset](#_asset).\n\n<a id=\"_manifest_repository\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines a visible watermark as a perceptible component of the digital content carrying some human-consumable information about the provenance of the asset.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s053-2-4-5-manifest-repository",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "2.4.5. Manifest Repository",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s053-2-4-5-manifest-repository.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 2.4.5. Manifest Repository\n\nA repository into which [C2PA Manifests](#_c2pa_manifest) and [C2PA Manifest Stores](#_c2pa_manifest_store) can be placed, and which can be searched using a [content binding](#_content_binding).\n\n<a id=\"_elements_of_a_content_credential\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines a manifest repository as a repository into which C2PA Manifests and C2PA Manifest Stores can be placed, and which can be searched using a content binding.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s054-3-elements-of-a-content-credential",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "3\\. Elements of a Content Credential",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s054-3-elements-of-a-content-credential.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "## 3\\. Elements of a Content Credential\n\nThis image shows how all these various elements come together to represent the C2PA architecture.\n\n![A diagram of how all the parts of a Content Credential go together](_images/Overview_Diagram.svg)\n\nFigure 3. Elements of a Content Credential\n\n<a id=\"_standard_terms\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Presents Figure 3, a diagram showing how the various elements of a Content Credential come together to represent the C2PA architecture.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
