      "narrative": null,
      "content": "## 7\\. Entity Diagram\n\n[Figure 4, “C2PA Entity Diagram”](#entity-diagram) provides a look at how all of the pieces of the C2PA system integrate and relate to each other.\n\n![C2PA Entity Diagram](https://kroki.io/plantuml/svg/eNqlVEtvEzEQPmd_xSg9REJKV3DgsKBKtAXEAZBobghFznqSjOq1V7bTElD_O2Pvw7tJaJCItIo9j2--eXiyGXz5unhfAGpPfg_kQGgQioSDtbFQKuFc9tb5vcKrLN5uSWysqOB3Bo06nsJvBsJ7S6udxwAjoUK_NdJ16g9G-xujGHaldthJr0V5v7Fmp2Wj26NS5jHrMZsYWlSdxxaFRNtHBQi4d_QL4eXrXjYI9kBGoR9bh3xgZZRsxU9Z-J6yt3mbajZRuEEts8nkBbxTCiwq4clot6Was7MIjvRmp4SFnVbIFI3fon0kx5oaS1oTNt4fLaIGRZqrYrG26LjYgNUKpUSZl8xHkHbR9poLc2TK93uULFijRV1i",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Presents Figure 4, the C2PA Entity Diagram, showing how the parts of the C2PA system integrate and relate to each other. It explains that an asset embeds a C2PA Manifest Store holding one or more C2PA Manifests, the last of which is the active manifest whose content bindings are validated against the asset's digital content. Within each manifest, the assertion store collects the assertions (including any ingredient assertions and the content binding), and the claim references them by URI and is cryptographically signed by the claim signature. Green lines in the diagram denote containment and blue lines denote logical references, and the Manifests, Assertions, Claims and Binding to Content sections give the full structural descriptions.",
