      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "States that before a claim can be finalized, all assertions need to be created and stored in a newly created C2PA Assertion Store. When creating a standard manifest where not all binding information is known at claim creation time, it directs use of the multiple step processing method to set up the information and fill it in later.",
