      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "10.3.2.1. Adding Assertions and Redactions",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s100-10-3-2-1-adding-assertions-and-redactions.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 10.3.2.1. Adding Assertions and Redactions\n\nThe claim shall contain a `created_assertions` field and may contain a `gathered_assertions` field. The combined values from those two fields represent a list of all of the URI references for all assertions that were added to the assertion store that are being \"claimed\" by this claim. In a standard manifest, the `created_assertions` field’s value shall include at least one assertion that represents a [hard binding](#_hard_bindings).\n\nIf any assertions in ingredient claims are being redacted, their URI references shall be added to list which is",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Requires the claim to contain a created_assertions field and allows a gathered_assertions field, whose combined values list the URI references of all assertions added to the assertion store that the claim is claiming. In a standard manifest, created_assertions shall include at least one assertion representing a hard binding. URI references to any assertions in ingredient claims that are being redacted shall be added to the redacted_assertions field.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
