        "text": "Refers to Section 12.3 Digital Signatures for producing the signature, and requires that for both standard and update manifests the payload field of Sig_structure be the serialized CBOR of the claim document, using detached content mode. The resulting serialized COSE_Sign1_Tagged structure is written into the C2PA Claim Signature box.",
