      "target": "../sections/s117-11-3-1-common.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 11.3.1. Common\n\nAll C2PA Manifests shall contain an [assertion store](#assertion-store-arch), a [claim](#_claims) and a [claim signature](#_signing_a_claim).\n\n<a id=\"_standard_manifests\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
