      "target": "../sections/s118-11-3-2-standard-manifests.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 11.3.2. Standard Manifests\n\nA standard C2PA Manifest shall contain exactly one [hard binding to content](#_binding_to_content) assertion.\n\n<a id=\"_update_manifests\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Requires a standard C2PA Manifest to contain exactly one hard binding to content assertion.",
