    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s119-11-3-3-update-manifests",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "11.3.3. Update Manifests",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s119-11-3-3-update-manifests.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 11.3.3. Update Manifests\n\nIn a workflow where additional assertions need to be added to an existing C2PA Manifest, but no changes are made to the [digital content](#_digital_content) or other data covered by [content bindings](#_binding_to_content), an Update Manifest should be used.\n\nAn Update Manifest shall not contain assertions of types `c2pa.hash.data`, `c2pa.hash.boxes`, `c2pa.hash.collection.data`, `c2pa.hash.segment`, `c2pa.hash.bmff.v3`, or `c2pa.hash.multi-asset`, because the content has not changed and therefore the bindings need not be updated.\n\nIn cases where the existing con",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Recommends an Update Manifest when assertions are added to an existing C2PA Manifest without changing the digital content or other data covered by content bindings, and forbids it from containing c2pa.hash.data, c2pa.hash.boxes, c2pa.hash.collection.data, c2pa.hash.segment, c2pa.hash.bmff.v3 or c2pa.hash.multi-asset assertions. Where the existing content binding locates the C2PA Manifest Store by file offset and length, the store shall start at the same offset after updating, though its length may change. An Update Manifest may contain c2pa.actions or c2pa.actions.v2 assertions only with the actions c2pa.edited.metadata, c2pa.opened, c2pa.published or c2pa.redacted, and shall not contain a thumbnail assertion, since other actions or a thumbnail imply changes to the digital content. It shall contain exactly one c2pa.ingredient.v3 assertion with activeManifest and claimSignature URI references to the updated asset's C2PA Manifest and Claim Signature and a relationship of parentOf, where that ingredient manifest may be a standard or update manifest.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s120-11-4-ingredient-storage",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "11.4. Ingredient Storage",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s120-11-4-ingredient-storage.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "### 11.4. Ingredient Storage\n\nWhen a C2PA Manifest includes [ingredient assertions](#ingredient_assertion), and an ingredient contains a C2PA Manifest Store, the C2PA Manifests it contains are normally included in the C2PA Manifest Store of the new asset to ensure that the provenance data is kept intact, as described in [Section 10.3.2.2, “Adding Ingredients”](#_adding_ingredients).\n\n![C2PA Manifest Store With an Ingredient](https://kroki.io/plantuml/svg/eNqdlclu2zAQhs_SU0xzqJNDDDTtKQgCeGmKBtkQozuKekyNZNYUKZC0W6Pwu5ekLEtOJaMtDzbE4Xzz8-cWg2s9QCHUDwM5_8llBivUXC0NqNl3YtYAl4BgXEQQJBwzjXns80LWtzIpj",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Describes how, when a C2PA Manifest includes ingredient assertions and an ingredient contains a C2PA Manifest Store, its C2PA Manifests are normally included in the new asset's C2PA Manifest Store to keep the provenance data intact, as described in Section 10.3.2.2 Adding Ingredients. Figure 9 shows a C2PA Manifest Store with an ingredient. Notes that the previously supported Data Box Store (c2pa.databoxes) is covered for historical reference in Section H.4 Data Box Store of Appendix H Deprecated Constructs.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
