      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "12.3.7. Inclusion of signer icons",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s162-12-3-7-inclusion-of-signer-icons.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 12.3.7. Inclusion of signer icons\n\nA C2PA Manifest Consumer may wish to display an icon or logo for the signer. To locate such a graphic, it shall look inside the embedded certificate for a logotype as defined in [RFC 9399](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9399). If no logotype is present, the Manifest Consumer may use icons or logos from other sources in an implementation-dependent manner.\n\n<a id=\"_trust_model\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Requires a C2PA Manifest Consumer that wants to display a signer icon or logo to look for a logotype, as defined in RFC 9399, inside the embedded certificate. If none is present, the consumer may use icons or logos from other sources in an implementation-dependent manner.",
