      "narrative": null,
      "content": "## 13\\. Trust Model\n\n> **NOTE:**\n> In this section, \"user\" refers to human actors that are using C2PA-compliant validators in consumption and authoring scenarios.\n\n<a id=\"_overview_5\"></a>",
