    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s164-13-1-overview",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "13.1. Overview",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s164-13-1-overview.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "### 13.1. Overview\n\n![C2PA Trust Model Diagram](https://kroki.io/ditaa/png/eNqtks1qwzAMx-95Ct2NX6BslxQKO2_sWPActTVLE5CcQiAPP8Wxk3hLYIz9T7J-6MuS0lEKvklpvctyroohOYc36tgzsLs2SODbYQkQM1LH3AUanAlLltcpTJyMtiMEf0NHwo6EFTbemVqYC-alj1VY-LupXWV8S8OqlyedS8Z4mSr_ZPmYksWeTmXs2s7FeXTYciLr5leSyLKMWdS__O74PsMfdS52O_2NDiH8sMnUc5KaV_tIiwjbjeHpKgwzkndtIybhklQse0P7OUU734NpqqW60npzW0dJ1N2Rtvn8dQB3UyF89OM1pcuEvHpLhNbX_Xxbxf6XZGPHE_wC98W3Jg==?id=trust-model-diagram)\n\nFigure 11. C2PA Trust Model Diagram\n\n[Figure 11, “C2PA Trust Model Diagram”](#trust-model-diagram) shows, in yellow, green and red, the three entities",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Presents Figure 11, the C2PA Trust Model Diagram, showing the three entities specified in the trust model, which concerns trust in a signer's identity. Describes the consumer, who is not specified in the trust model, as using the signer's identity along with other trust signals to decide whether assertions about an asset are true.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
