      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "14.1.2. Phases of Validation",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s185-14-1-2-phases-of-validation.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 14.1.2. Phases of Validation\n\nThese phases, which are listed in no particular order, are described in the following clauses:\n\n*   [Section 14.10, “Validate the Assertions”](#_validate_the_assertions): Validation of the assertions.\n    \n*   [Section 14.11, “Validate the Ingredients”](#_validate_the_ingredients): Validation of the ingredients, if any.\n    \n*   [Section 14.8, “Validate the Time Stamp”](#_validate_the_time_stamp): Validation of the time stamp.\n    \n*   [Section 14.9, “Validate the Credential Revocation Information”](#_validate_the_credential_revocation_information): Validatio",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Lists the phases of validation, in no particular order: validating the assertions (Section 14.10), the ingredients if any (Section 14.11), the time stamp (Section 14.8), the credential revocation information (Section 14.9), the claim signature (Section 14.7), and the asset's content (Section 14.12). States that the results determine whether a manifest is Well-Formed, Valid or Trusted as described in Section 13.3, Validation states.",
        "state": "draft",
