    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s188-14-2-1-general",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "14.2.1. General",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s188-14-2-1-general.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 14.2.1. General\n\nThe validation algorithm shall return a consolidated set of validation results, per the [CDDL Definition](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8610) schema in [Section 14.2.2, “Validation Structures”](#_validation_structures), for the all manifests in the asset’s C2PA Manifest Store, including the active manifest as well all other manifests in the C2PA Manifest Store that are referenced via ingredient assertions.\n\nValidation results include a standard set of success, informational, and failure codes, as defined in [Appendix D, _Standard Validation Status Codes_](#validation_",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Requires the validation algorithm to return a consolidated set of results, per the schema in Section 14.2.2, for all manifests in the asset's C2PA Manifest Store, including the active manifest and those referenced by ingredient assertions. Specifies standard success, informational and failure codes from Appendix D and permits custom codes that follow entity-specific namespace syntax. Requires a claim generator adding an ingredient to act as a validator, run the full algorithm on it, and record the results in the ingredient assertion's validationResults field. Permits results to include a SemVer specVersion and either a deprecated trustListUri or a trustListUris field identifying the trust lists used.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
