        "text": "Requires the hash algorithm for a hashed_uri structure to be taken from its own alg field if present, otherwise from the nearest enclosing structure with an alg field, otherwise from the claim's alg field. Requires the claim to be rejected with algorithm.unsupported if no alg field is found in any of these locations.",
