      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s195-14-4-4-algorithm-validation.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 14.4.4. Algorithm validation\n\nOnce the hashing algorithm is determined, it shall be compared to the values in the allowed list or the deprecated list in [Section 12.1, “Hashing”](#_hashing). If it is not present in either list, the claim shall be rejected with a failure code of `algorithm.unsupported`. If the algorithm is present in the deprecated list, the claim shall be issued an informational code of `algorithm.deprecated`.\n\n<a id=\"_locating_the_active_manifest\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Requires the determined hashing algorithm to be compared against the allowed and deprecated lists in Section 12.1, Hashing. Requires rejecting the claim with algorithm.unsupported if it is in neither list, and issuing the informational code algorithm.deprecated if it is in the deprecated list.",
        "state": "draft",
