    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s197-14-5-1-general",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "14.5.1. General",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s197-14-5-1-general.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 14.5.1. General\n\nThe last C2PA Manifest superbox in the C2PA Manifest Store superbox shall be considered the active manifest, but locating the C2PA Manifest Store may involve looking in a number of possible locations.\n\nLocating the C2PA Manifest Store is a prerequisite to validation and is not itself associated with a validation status code. If no C2PA Manifest Store can be located by the methods described below, the asset shall be treated as if no manifests were located. Where an embedding method admits only a single C2PA Manifest Store within a given location, more than one in that loca",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Requires the last C2PA Manifest superbox in the C2PA Manifest Store superbox to be considered the active manifest, noting that locating the store may involve several locations and is a prerequisite with no validation status code of its own. Requires an asset to be treated as if no manifests were located when no store can be found, or when more than one store is found where an embedding method admits only one. Notes that implementations may surface additional information about why no manifests were located.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
