    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s199-14-5-2-1-general",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "14.5.2.1. General",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s199-14-5-2-1-general.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 14.5.2.1. General\n\nThe C2PA Manifest Store shall be located by the validator embedded inside the asset at the [standard locations for embedding manifests](#_embedding). If no embedded C2PA Manifest Store is found, and if an asset was retrieved via an HTTP connection, a validator may look for a `Link` header, as described in the [Link Header](#_by_link_header) clause below, to determine if a C2PA Manifest Store is present.\n\n> **NOTE:**\n> Checking the `Link` header, if present, allows a validator to determine if a C2PA Manifest Store is present without having to download the entire asset.",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Requires the validator to locate the C2PA Manifest Store embedded at the standard embedding locations, and permits checking an HTTP Link header if none is found. Requires multiple embedded stores to be considered invalid, with validation that should treat this as no manifests located and with none included in an ingredient assertion. Requires an embedded store to take precedence over a remote one indicated by a Link header. Requires rejection with manifest.inaccessible.encrypted if the store is unreadable due to encryption (excluding mechanisms such as the PDF Identity crypt filter) and with manifest.inaccessible.malformed if it is readable but cannot be interpreted as a valid store.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s200-14-5-2-2-special-considerations-for-pdf",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
