      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "14.5.2.3. Special Considerations for HTML",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s201-14-5-2-3-special-considerations-for-html.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 14.5.2.3. Special Considerations for HTML\n\nFor HTML-based assets, the C2PA Manifest Store shall be located by following the procedure defined in [Section A.7, “Embedding Manifests into HTML”](#embedding_manifests_into_html). If more than one C2PA manifest element is present in the `head` element — more than one `script` element with `type=\"application/c2pa\"`, both a `script` element and a `link` element referencing a C2PA Manifest Store, or otherwise — the asset shall be treated as if no manifests were located.\n\n<a id=\"_special_considerations_for_structured_text\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Requires the C2PA Manifest Store for HTML assets to be located using the procedure in Section A.7, Embedding Manifests into HTML. Requires the asset to be treated as if no manifests were located if the head element contains more than one C2PA manifest element, such as multiple script elements with type=\"application/c2pa\" or both a script and a link element.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
