        "text": "Requires the C2PA Manifest Store for unstructured text to be located using the procedure in Section A.8, Embedding Manifests into Unstructured Text. Requires the asset to be treated as if no manifests were located if no valid C2PATextManifestWrapper, or more than one, is found.",
