    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s236-14-10-4-2-2-c2pa-external-reference-validation",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "14.10.4.2.2. `c2pa.external-reference` validation",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s236-14-10-4-2-2-c2pa-external-reference-validation.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "###### 14.10.4.2.2. `c2pa.external-reference` validation\n\nIf the assertion’s label is `c2pa.external-reference`:\n\n1.  Check that the assertion contains a `location` field with a `url` field. If it is missing, the claim shall be rejected with a failure code of `assertion.external-reference.malformed`.\n    \n2.  If the `location` field contains one of `alg` or `hash` but not both, the claim shall be rejected with a failure code of `assertion.external-reference.malformed`.\n    \n3.  If the `location` field contains both `alg` and `hash` (hashed variant) and the data is retrieved from the URI in the",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Specifies validation of c2pa.external-reference assertions: a location field with a url field is required, and location must contain both or neither of alg and hash, otherwise rejection with assertion.external-reference.malformed. When hashed data is retrieved, a hash mismatch is reported as assertion.external-reference.hashMismatch. A label field naming an actions, cloud-data, external-reference, hard binding, multi-asset hash or ingredient label causes rejection with assertion.external-reference.malformed, and a retrieved JUMBF box whose label differs from the label field is reported as assertion.external-reference.labelMismatch.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
