        "text": "Describes how hashed_uri and hashed_ext_uri references in standard assertions are validated, excluding the activeManifest field of c2pa.ingredient.v3 and the externalResources entries of c2pa.linked-resource-integrity. A retrieved hashed_ext_uri follows section 14.10.5.2 Validation of External References. For a hashed_uri, a missing url or unlocatable destination is a validation failure with hashedURI.missing; otherwise the algorithm is determined per section 14.4, and a missing hash field or a mismatch with the computed hash causes rejection with hashedURI.mismatch.",
