      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "14.12. Validate the Asset’s Content",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s266-14-12-validate-the-asset-s-content.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "### 14.12. Validate the Asset’s Content\n\nThe asset’s content shall be validated using the [hard binding](#_hard_bindings) in the active manifest if the active manifest is a standard manifest. If the active manifest is an update manifest, the hard binding shall be found in the `parentOf` ingredient’s manifest, or if that manifest is also an update manifest, by following the chain of `parentOf` ingredients to the first standard manifest. If no standard manifest is found, or the standard manifest has no hard binding in `created_assertions`, then the active manifest’s claim shall be rejected with",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Requires the asset's content to be validated using the hard binding in the active manifest if it is a standard manifest, or, for an update manifest, by following the chain of parentOf ingredients to the first standard manifest. If no standard manifest is found or it has no hard binding in created_assertions, the active manifest's claim shall be rejected with claim.hardBindings.missing. Notes that an asset may consist of multiple parts with their own hashes, per section 16.3.5 Multi-Asset Hash, which may be validated separately.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
