      "content": "#### 14.12.2. Validating a BMFF-hash\n\nFor any portions of an asset rendered for presentation to a user, including but not limited to audio, video, or text, the corresponding hard binding corresponding to the rendered content shall be validated in accordance with [Section 12.2.2, “Hard Bindings”](#_hard_bindings). If the standard hard binding does not validate, and a multi-asset hash assertion is present, it shall be validated as described in [Section 14.12.4, “Validating a multi-asset hash”](#validating_a_multi_asset_hash). If at any time content fails to be validated, the validator shall clea",
