        "text": "Specifies validation of a c2pa.hash.boxes assertion: the boxes field must be present (else assertion.boxesHash.malformed), boxes must appear in the asset in the listed order (else assertion.boxesHash.mismatch), and unlisted boxes cause assertion.boxesHash.unknownBox. The hash algorithm is taken from the box-hash-map, box-map or Claim alg in that order, with algorithm.unsupported if none is valid; exclusion ranges are relative to the box given by boxIndex and must exist, not overlap and not be negative (else assertion.boxesHash.malformed), and missing names fields are also malformed. Hashes are computed over each box or range of named boxes, skipping exclusions and boxes marked excluded; data in the manifest store exclusion other than the store and padding, exclusions running past a box, or a missing or mismatched hash cause assertion.boxesHash.mismatch, with fallback to a multi-asset hash if present. Extra exclusions yield assertion.boxesHash.additionalExclusionsPresent, pad fields are ignored, and success yields assertion.boxesHash.match.",
