      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 14.12.3.2. JPEG-XL Special Handling\n\nWhen validating JPEG-XL the C2PA Manifest Store is a top level JUMBF box (JUMB). The box containing the C2PA Manifest Store shall be identified with the special `C2PA` box identifier. The C2PA Manifest Store is identified by it being a JUMBF superbox with a label of `c2pa` and a JUMBF type UUID of `63327061-0011-0010-8000-00AA00389B71` as described in [Section 11.5, “Serialization”](#_serialization).\n\n<a id=\"_font_special_handling\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "States that in JPEG-XL the C2PA Manifest Store is a top-level JUMBF box, and requires the box containing it to be identified with the special C2PA box identifier; the store is recognised as a JUMBF superbox labelled c2pa with type UUID 63327061-0011-0010-8000-00AA00389B71.",
