      "target": "../sections/s287-14-12-5-2-extras-for-zip.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 14.12.5.2. Extras for ZIP\n\nIn a ZIP file with an associated C2PA Manifest, the [collection data hash](#_collection_data_hash) contains the additional `zip_central_directory_hash` field. As described [earlier](#_hashing_the_zip_central_directory), this field contains a hash of every \"central directory header\" in the ZIP Central Directory as well as the \"end of central directory record\" (which is the last part of a ZIP file). The hash algorithm used for this field is the same as the one used for the `hash` field in the `c2pa.hash.collection.data` assertion.\n\nWhen validating a ZIP file, the",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "States that for ZIP files the collection data hash includes a zip_central_directory_hash field hashing every central directory header and the end of central directory record with the same algorithm as the hash field. A validator shall check that this field is present and matches, rejecting the manifest with assertion.collectionHash.mismatch otherwise.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
