    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s292-14-12-6-3-validating-the-chain-of-checkpoints",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "14.12.6.3. Validating the chain of checkpoints",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s292-14-12-6-3-validating-the-chain-of-checkpoints.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 14.12.6.3. Validating the chain of checkpoints\n\nEach checkpoint after the first records the position and digest of the sentinel line of the checkpoint that precedes it, and references that checkpoint’s manifest as a `parentOf` ingredient. Beginning with the active checkpoint, the validator shall, for each checkpoint whose segment hash assertion contains a `predecessorSentinel` field:\n\n1.  Read the bytes `[predecessorSentinel.start, predecessorSentinel.start + predecessorSentinel.length)` of the file and compute their hash. If the resultant hash does not match the value of the `predecesso",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Describes validating the chain of checkpoints, where each later checkpoint records its predecessor's sentinel line position and digest and references its manifest as a parentOf ingredient. Starting from the active checkpoint, for each checkpoint with predecessorSentinel the validator shall hash the referenced bytes (rejecting with assertion.segmentHash.predecessorMismatch on mismatch), obtain the preceding manifest store from them, and validate its segment hash assertion per sections 14.12.6.1 and 14.12.6.2; a checkpoint without predecessorSentinel completes the chain. If an earlier checkpoint's externally stored manifest cannot be retrieved, the validator shall report manifest.inaccessible and treat that and all earlier segments as unverified, but shall not reject the active checkpoint on that basis alone.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
