        "text": "States that beginning with version 2.5 the term live video was renamed live media to reflect broader scope, with live video now considered a subset. Identifiers originally defined with livevideo nomenclature, including CDDL rule and file names, assertion labels and validation failure codes, are retained without renaming for compatibility.",
