      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "15.7.1. Per-segment C2PA Manifest Box method",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s320-15-7-1-per-segment-c2pa-manifest-box-method.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 15.7.1. Per-segment C2PA Manifest Box method\n\nWhen using the per-segment C2PA Manifest Box method, the C2PA Manifest of each segment is constructed in the same way that is described in [Section A.5, “Embedding manifests into BMFF-based assets”](#_embedding_manifests_into_bmff_based_assets), but with the `bmff-hash-map` only hashing the bytes of that segment. In addition, a [Section 15.4.2, “Live Media Segment Assertion”](#livevideo_segment) shall be included in the manifest to provide metadata about the segment.\n\n<a id=\"_verifiable_segment_info_method\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Specifies that, with the per-segment C2PA Manifest Box method, each segment's C2PA Manifest is constructed as described in Section A.5, Embedding manifests into BMFF-based assets, except that the bmff-hash-map hashes only that segment's bytes. Requires that a Live Media Segment Assertion (Section 15.4.2) be included in the manifest to provide metadata about the segment.",
        "state": "draft",
