    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s323-15-8-1-initial-common-validation-steps",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "15.8.1. Initial/Common Validation Steps",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s323-15-8-1-initial-common-validation-steps.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 15.8.1. Initial/Common Validation Steps\n\nIf the segment being validated is an initialization segment, the validator shall look for the presence of an `mdat` box. If an `mdat` box is found, the validation shall fail with a failure code of `livevideo.init.invalid`.\n\nIf a BMFF/CMAF segment contains neither a C2PA Manifest Box nor an `emsg` box that meets the requirements [defined above](#c2pa_emsg_box), the validation of that segment shall fail with a failure code of `livevideo.segment.invalid`.\n\nIf an E-RTMP-delivered segment is not closed by one or more `Metadata` messages carrying a `c2pa",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Specifies the initial validation steps common to live media segments. An initialization segment containing an mdat box fails with livevideo.init.invalid; a BMFF/CMAF segment with neither a C2PA Manifest Box nor a conforming emsg box, or an E-RTMP segment not closed by Metadata messages carrying a conforming c2paSegmentInfo, fails with livevideo.segment.invalid. A C2PA Manifest Box found in a segment shall be validated per Chapter 14, Validation, failing with livevideo.manifest.invalid if it does not validate. For Enhanced RTMP (V2) content, the validator shall have obtained the C2PA Manifest identified by the manifestId of the rtmp-segment-info-map (else livevideo.init.invalid), shall validate it with its hard binding checked against the E-RTMP initialization data, and shall fail the segment with livevideo.init.invalid if any coded frame's most recent codec configuration is not the one bound by that manifest.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
