    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s324-15-8-2-per-segment-c2pa-manifest-box-validation",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "15.8.2. Per-segment C2PA Manifest Box Validation",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s324-15-8-2-per-segment-c2pa-manifest-box-validation.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 15.8.2. Per-segment C2PA Manifest Box Validation\n\nIf the C2PA Manifest present in the C2PA Manifest Box contains a live media segment assertion, the validator shall perform the following tests:\n\n*   Unless the segment is the first segment, ensure that the `sequenceNumber` field in the live media segment assertion is greater than the `sequenceNumber` of the previous segment. If it is not, the validation of that segment shall fail with a failure code of `livevideo.assertion.invalid`.\n    \n*   Ensure that the `streamId` field in the live media segment assertion matches the `streamId` from th",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Lists the tests a validator shall perform when the C2PA Manifest in a segment's C2PA Manifest Box contains a live media segment assertion. The sequenceNumber must exceed that of the previous segment (unless it is the first) and the streamId must match the previous segment's, otherwise livevideo.assertion.invalid; continuityMethod must be present, otherwise livevideo.continuityMethod.invalid. If continuityMethod is \"c2pa.manifestId\", a previousManifestId field is required (else livevideo.continuityMethod.invalid) and must match the previous segment's manifestId (else livevideo.segment.invalid), and any other continuity method the validator does not recognize or support fails with livevideo.continuityMethod.invalid.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
