      "narrative": null,
      "content": "### 16.3. Content Binding & Integrity\n\nThese assertions bind a manifest to the content of an asset and enable a Manifest Consumer to detect tampering, using either cryptographic hashes of the asset’s bytes or soft (perceptual) bindings.\n\n<a id=\"_data_hash\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Describes the content binding and integrity assertions as those that bind a manifest to an asset's content and let a Manifest Consumer detect tampering, using either cryptographic hashes of the asset's bytes or soft (perceptual) bindings.",
