      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.3.1.3. Special consideration for JPEG 1",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s334-16-3-1-3-special-consideration-for-jpeg-1.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 16.3.1.3. Special consideration for JPEG 1\n\nWhen hashing a JPEG 1 (.jpg) file into which the C2PA Manifest will be embedded, the APP11 marker (`FFEB`) and the segment’s length (`Lp`) of all APP11 segments containing the JUMBF data shall be included in the exclusion range.\n\n> **NOTE:**\n> All the APP11 segments containing the C2PA Manifest JUMBF are contiguous so that only a single range is required.\n\n<a id=\"_special_consideration_for_png\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Requires that, when hashing a JPEG 1 file into which the C2PA Manifest will be embedded, the APP11 marker (FFEB) and segment length (Lp) of all APP11 segments containing the JUMBF data be included in the exclusion range. Notes that these APP11 segments are contiguous, so a single range is required.",
        "state": "draft",
