      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.3.1.5. Special considerations for TIFF-based",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s336-16-3-1-5-special-considerations-for-tiff-based.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 16.3.1.5. Special considerations for TIFF-based\n\nWhen hashing a TIFF-based asset into which the C2PA Manifest will be embedded, the `count` field of the C2PA Manifest Store’s IFD Entry (representing the length of the JUMBF data) should be included in the exclusion ranges. This is to support Update Manifests, which could change the size of the embedded C2PA Manifest Store.\n\n<a id=\"_special_considerations_for_riff_based\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Recommends that, when hashing a TIFF-based asset into which the C2PA Manifest will be embedded, the count field of the C2PA Manifest Store's IFD Entry be included in the exclusion ranges, to support Update Manifests that could change the size of the embedded C2PA Manifest Store.",
        "state": "draft",
