      "narrative": null,
      "content": "###### 16.3.3.3.3. TIFF-specific Handling\n\n> **NOTE:**\n> Previous versions of this specification documented use of general box hash with TIFF. However, the use of indirection and other characteristics of the TIFF structure make box hashing awkward, inefficient, and prone to interoperability issues, so it has been decided to remove the general box hash support for TIFF, in favor of the data hash.\n\n<a id=\"_gif_specific_handling\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Notes that general box hash support for TIFF, documented in previous versions, has been removed in favor of the data hash because TIFF's indirection and structure make box hashing awkward, inefficient and prone to interoperability issues.",
