    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s363-16-3-4-3-fields",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.3.4.3. Fields",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s363-16-3-4-3-fields.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 16.3.4.3. Fields\n\nThe `uris` field consists of an array of `uri-hashed-data-map` values that represents a collection of assets. The `alg` field, if present, shall be a string that is one of the allowed hash algorithms as defined in [Section 12.1, “Hashing”](#_hashing), and that algorithm shall be used to compute the hash of each member of the collection. If the `alg` field is not present, then the hashing algorithm shall be determined by the value of the `alg` field in the Claim.\n\nFor each `uri-hashed-data-map`, the `uri` field shall be present. Except in the container formats described",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines the collection data hash fields: uris is an array of uri-hashed-data-map values representing the collection, and alg, if present, shall name an allowed hash algorithm used for every member, otherwise the Claim's alg applies. Each entry shall have a uri that is a valid relative URI resolved against the manifest's location (except for container formats whose members use a native absolute URI, such as a WARC-Record-ID, where the uri shall be that identifier), and claim generators shall validate or sanitize URIs so that neither . nor .. appear. The uri shall not contain a query component, though a fragment is permitted, because it names a static hashed content item. The hash field holds the hash over all bytes of the content item with no exceptions, and the remaining fields are identical to those of an ingredient assertion.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
