    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s367-16-3-5-2-details",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.3.5.2. Details",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s367-16-3-5-2-details.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 16.3.5.2. Details\n\nA multi-asset hash assertion shall have a label of `c2pa.hash.multi-asset`. Although it contains hashes and modifies the handling of the [hard binding](#_hard_bindings), it is not considered a hard binding.\n\nA multi-asset hash assertion shall not appear in a [cloud data assertion](#_cloud_data) nor an [external reference assertion](#_external_reference).\n\nA multi-asset hash assertion should not be used with a [compressed manifest](#_compressed_manifests).\n\n> **NOTE:**\n> It is not clear if there exists a technical incompatibility between the two, so it is recommended to",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Requires the multi-asset hash assertion to be labelled c2pa.hash.multi-asset; although it contains hashes and modifies hard binding handling, it is not considered a hard binding, it shall not appear in a cloud data or external reference assertion, and it should not be used with a compressed manifest. Every part, including the primary part, shall be a part-hash-map in the parts array, listed in file order, contiguous, non-overlapping and covering every byte, with a location locator giving either byteOffset and length or a bmffBox whose payload (excluding header) is the part. The hashAssertion field shall be a hashed URI to a standard hard binding assertion whose label has .part and any multiple instance identifier appended (e.g. c2pa.hash.data.part__2), with absolute offsets computed relative to the part's start. The optional boolean field defaults to false, and a part's own C2PA Manifest that is not self-contained is recommended to be stored in the asset's Manifest Store and referenced through a componentOf ingredient.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
