      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Specifies the CDDL schema for the multi-asset hash assertion through the multi-asset-hash-map rule, whose parts array holds part-hash-map entries with a location (either a byte range or a bmffBox), a hashAssertion hashed URI and an optional optional flag; the full normative schema is in Section G.4.6, Multi-Asset Hash. Gives a CBOR diagnostic example of a two-part 33,333-byte asset with c2pa.hash.boxes.part and c2pa.hash.data.part assertions for the parts and an overall c2pa.hash.boxes assertion using c2pa.after, and illustrates its use for an HDR gain map in Figure 17.",
