      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.3.6.2. Details",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s371-16-3-6-2-details.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 16.3.6.2. Details\n\nA segment hash assertion shall have a label of `c2pa.hash.segment`. It is a [hard binding](#_hard_bindings), and shall be used only for the assets described in [Section A.3.17, “Embedding manifests into append-only text files”](#_embedding_manifests_into_append_only_text_files).\n\nThe `version` field shall be present and shall have a value of `1` for this version of this specification. An assertion that declares a version a validator does not recognise will be rejected during validation as described in [Section 14.12.6, “Validating a segment hash”](#_validating_a_segmen",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Requires the segment hash assertion to be labelled c2pa.hash.segment; it is a hard binding to be used only for assets described in Section A.3.17, and it shall not appear in a cloud data or external reference assertion. The version field shall be 1, alg (if present) shall name an allowed algorithm used for both hash and predecessorSentinel.hash (else the Claim's alg), segmentStart and segmentEnd mark the segment up to the start of the sentinel line (segmentStart being 0 for the first checkpoint), and hash covers [segmentStart, segmentEnd). The sentinelLength field shall be present when the sentinel line references the manifest store by external URI and absent when it embeds it inline, because the inline length cannot be known at signing time. The predecessorSentinel field shall be present for every checkpoint after the first, locating and hashing the preceding sentinel line, and absent for the first.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s372-16-3-6-3-schema-and-example",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
