      "target": "../sections/s381-16-4-provenance-workflow.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "### 16.4. Provenance & Workflow\n\nThese assertions record how an asset came to be - the actions performed on it and its relationships to other assets and external resources.\n\n<a id=\"_actions\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Describes the provenance and workflow assertions as those recording how an asset came to be, namely the actions performed on it and its relationships to other assets and external resources.",
