    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s383-16-4-1-1-description",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.4.1.1. Description",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s383-16-4-1-1-description.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 16.4.1.1. Description\n\nAn actions assertion provides information on edits and other actions taken that affect the asset’s content. There will be an array of actions - each action declaring _what_ took place on the asset and (optionally) _when_ it took place, along with possible other information such as what software performed the action. Except where noted in [Section 16.4.1.2, “Mandatory presence of at least one actions assertion”](#mandatory-inception-actions), the order of actions in this array is unspecified, and does not imply the order in which actions were performed.\n\nThere are t",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Describes the actions assertion as an array of actions on the asset's content, each stating what happened and optionally when and with what software, with array order unspecified except as noted in Section 16.4.1.2. Distinguishes the deprecated v1 (c2pa.actions) from v2, which shall be labelled c2pa.actions.v2 and may derive actions from a templates array, and notes that actions are modelled after XMP ResourceEvents. Requires each action value to be a pre-defined or entity-specific action name. Lists the pre-defined c2pa. actions in Table 4 with their meanings and whether each is a perceptible or non-editorial transformation (for example c2pa.created, c2pa.opened, c2pa.edited, c2pa.modified, c2pa.redacted, c2pa.watermarked.bound, with c2pa.color_adjustments, c2pa.removed and c2pa.watermarked deprecated), noting that perceptible means an action can produce a perceptible change, and lists the font. actions in Table 5, which replace the deprecated c2pa.font prefix.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
