    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s384-16-4-1-2-mandatory-presence-of-at-least-one-acti",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.4.1.2. Mandatory presence of at least one actions assertion",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s384-16-4-1-2-mandatory-presence-of-at-least-one-acti.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 16.4.1.2. Mandatory presence of at least one actions assertion\n\nThere shall be at least one actions assertion present in the `created_assertions` array of the Claim of a [standard C2PA Manifest](#_standard_manifests). Furthermore:\n\n*   If the asset was created _de novo_ (for example, as a result of performing a `File → New` operation in a creative tool, capturing a photo or video, or generating the media by a generative AI model), then the `actions` array in the first `c2pa.actions` assertion in the `created_assertions` array of the Claim shall have a `c2pa.created` action as its first e",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Requires at least one actions assertion in the created_assertions of a standard C2PA Manifest's Claim. For an asset created de novo the first c2pa.actions assertion shall begin with a c2pa.created action carrying an appropriate digitalSourceType (http://c2pa.org/digitalsourcetype/empty when there is no digital content); for an asset created by opening an existing asset as a parentOf ingredient it shall begin with c2pa.opened, with a matching c2pa.ingredient.v3 assertion referenced in the action's parameters ingredients. Notes that this does not apply to Update Manifests and that c2pa.opened needs no digitalSourceType, and requires that a manifest's actions contain no more than one c2pa.created or c2pa.opened action. Gives examples of a generative AI video, an image built from a template with placed photos, and a newsroom edit of a camera-captured photo.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s385-16-4-1-3-all-actions-included",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.4.1.3. All actions included",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s385-16-4-1-3-all-actions-included.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 16.4.1.3. All actions included\n\nThe generator shall set the `actions-map-v2` field, `allActionsIncluded`, which has a boolean value. If `allActionsIncluded` has a value of true, then the claim generator is stating that all actions performed on the asset are described in the actions assertion(s). If `allActionsIncluded` has a value of false, then the claim generator is stating that additional, unrecorded actions may have been performed. Manifest consumers should interpret an omitted `allActionsIncluded` field as indicating that additional, unrecorded actions may have been performed.\n\n> **",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Requires the claim generator to set the allActionsIncluded boolean in actions-map-v2, where true states that all actions performed are described and false states that unrecorded actions may have occurred; manifest consumers should interpret an omitted field as indicating that unrecorded actions may have been performed, and the field was optional in previous versions. Requires allActionsIncluded to be true when an asset is opened only to record c2pa.opened and immediately re-saved without other changes. Notes that external reference assertions with a hashed location can provide bound data about a process and be linked to actions via relatedAssertions.",
        "state": "draft",
