      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.4.1.4.1. Description",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s387-16-4-1-4-1-description.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "###### 16.4.1.4.1. Description\n\nAn action may include a free-text description, in the `description` field, of what an action does. This is most useful for non-standard actions, however, it may also be used as a way to provide additional information about a standard action. For example, a `c2pa.edited` action could have a `description` that says \"Paintbrush tool\".\n\n<a id=\"_reason\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Allows an action to include a free-text description field explaining what the action does, most useful for non-standard actions but also usable to add information to a standard action, such as \"Paintbrush tool\" for c2pa.edited.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
