    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s398-16-4-1-6-1-templates",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.4.1.6.1. Templates",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s398-16-4-1-6-1-templates.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "###### 16.4.1.6.1. Templates\n\nThe elements of the `templates` array, in a v2 action, are described using a combination of common elements about actions, along with some template-specific values. These values are combined by a C2PA Manifest Consumer with actions of the same name, or with all actions (if the value of the `action` field is the special `*` value), to get a full picture of an action. If there are multiple templates that apply to the same action, then the values are merged starting with the `\\*` template (if present) and then applied in the order they appear in the `templates` array",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Describes v2 action templates, which a C2PA Manifest Consumer combines with actions of the same name, or with all actions when the template's action is *, merging multiple applicable templates starting with * and then in array order. Requires the consumer to take template values and overlay the action's own values, replacing any with the same name, and illustrates this with examples and Figure 18, Actions Template Flow. Template parameters are merged key by key with the action's parameters, the action's values taking precedence, or used unchanged if the action has none. The templateParameters key is deprecated in favor of parameters, and consumers shall treat its pairs as parameters using the same precedence rules.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s399-16-4-1-6-2-softwareagents",
