    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s402-16-4-1-8-related-actions",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.4.1.8. Related Actions",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s402-16-4-1-8-related-actions.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 16.4.1.8. Related Actions\n\nWhen a series of actions are related to each other, usually taking place at the same time, it can be useful to associate them accordingly. The `related` field, in the v2 action, provides a place to list the additional actions that are related. Each related action should be a subset of the primary action, only including those fields that differ. Just as with an action template, the values are merged with those of the primary action, by a C2PA Manifest Consumer to get a full picture of each related action.\n\n<a id=\"_asset_renditions\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Describes the v2 related field for listing additional actions related to a primary action, usually occurring at the same time. Recommends that each related action include only the fields that differ from the primary action, with a C2PA Manifest Consumer merging the values with the primary action, as with a template, to get the full picture.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s403-16-4-1-9-asset-renditions",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.4.1.9. Asset Renditions",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s403-16-4-1-9-asset-renditions.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 16.4.1.9. Asset Renditions\n\nAsset renditions are a common occurrence when distributing media on the internet. These renditions are often created for the purpose of delivering media to consumers in differing connectivity, screen resolution, and other environments. We can use the `actions` assertion to help consuming actors understand the intention of certain claim creators to create asset renditions.\n\nThe presence of only `c2pa.published`, `c2pa.transcoded` and `c2pa.repackaged` actions in a `c2pa.actions` assertion provides a signal to the Manifest Consumer that the signer is asserting t",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Describes using the actions assertion to signal a claim creator's intent when creating asset renditions for different connectivity, resolution and other environments. The presence of only c2pa.published, c2pa.transcoded and c2pa.repackaged actions signals that the signer asserts no editorial changes to the digital content occurred between the ingredient(s) and this asset, and a single parentOf ingredient further signals that the asset was derived directly from that parent.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s404-16-4-1-10-soft-binding-lookup",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.4.1.10. Soft Binding Lookup",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s404-16-4-1-10-soft-binding-lookup.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 16.4.1.10. Soft Binding Lookup\n\nWhen performing either a `c2pa.opened` or `c2pa.placed` action with an asset that does not contain a C2PA Manifest, the claim generator may use a soft binding lookup to find the C2PA Manifest for that asset. If successful, the claim generator should add the located C2PA Manifest as the value of the `activeManifest` field in the ingredient assertion. If it does so, then the ingredient assertion shall also contain a `softBindingsMatched` field with a value of true and a `softBindingAlgorithmsMatched` whose value contains at least one entry in the array.\n\n> *",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Allows a claim generator performing c2pa.opened or c2pa.placed with an asset lacking a C2PA Manifest to use a soft binding lookup to find its manifest, and recommends adding any located manifest as the ingredient assertion's activeManifest. If it does so, the ingredient assertion shall also contain softBindingsMatched set to true and a softBindingAlgorithmsMatched array with at least one entry, indicating to consumers that a lookup was used. Notes that validation failures are to be expected in the ingredient assertion because recovered manifests usually carry non-matching hard bindings, and gives a CBOR diagnostic example.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s405-16-4-1-11-removing-previous-ingredients",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.4.1.11. Removing Previous Ingredients",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s405-16-4-1-11-removing-previous-ingredients.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 16.4.1.11. Removing Previous Ingredients\n\nWhen a deletion includes all of the content of a given ingredient, a claim generator may use a `c2pa.deleted` action to indicate that the previously composed asset ingredient (recorded in a previous manifest as an ingredient assertion with a `componentOf` relationship) has been removed from the content, and should not be considered part of the current asset. A claim generator or user may also wish to redact that ingredient assertion, in which case a `c2pa.redacted` action should be used as well, and the `c2pa.deleted` action should reference the",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Allows a claim generator to use a c2pa.deleted action when a deletion removes all the content of an ingredient previously recorded with a componentOf relationship, indicating it should no longer be considered part of the asset. If that ingredient assertion is also redacted, a c2pa.redacted action should be used as well and the c2pa.deleted action should reference the redacted ingredient assertion.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s406-16-4-1-12-relationship-between-actions-and-ingre",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
