      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Lists eight deprecated actions (c2pa.copied, c2pa.formatted, c2pa.version_updated, c2pa.printed, c2pa.managed, c2pa.produced, c2pa.saved and c2pa.removed), which shall no longer be written into c2pa.actions or c2pa.actions.v2 assertions but may appear in pre-existing manifests.",
