    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s412-16-4-2-2-process-evidence",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.4.2.2. Process Evidence",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s412-16-4-2-2-process-evidence.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 16.4.2.2. Process Evidence\n\nThe hashed variant of an external reference assertion may be used to reference externally-stored creation-process evidence. The `data_types` field on the `hashed-ext-uri-map` location identifies the kind of evidence using an `asset-type-map`. The following pre-defined values are available:\n\n`c2pa.types.audit-log`\n\nA structured log of creation-phase events collected by a local or remote observer during the creation process.\n\n> **NOTE:**\n> All aspects of the log are implementation dependent.\n\n`c2pa.types.version-history`\n\nA record of revisions to the asset over",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "States that the hashed variant of an external reference assertion may point to externally stored creation-process evidence, identified through the data_types field using the predefined values c2pa.types.audit-log and c2pa.types.version-history (or entity-specific types following namespace syntax), with processStart and processEnd in metadata describing the process where applicable.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
