    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s438-16-5-12-1-general",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.5.12.1. General",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s438-16-5-12-1-general.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 16.5.12.1. General\n\nIf the ingredient has an existing C2PA Manifest Store, then all C2PA Manifests in the ingredient’s C2PA Manifest Store that have undergone validation, and that do not already exist in the asset’s C2PA Manifest Store, shall be copied by the claim generator into the asset’s C2PA Manifest Store, except as outlined in [Section 16.5.13, “Copying existing manifests”](#_copying_existing_manifests) or when directed not to do so (for example via user input or via configuration).\n\nThe claim generator should also copy into the asset’s C2PA Manifest Store any additional C2PA Mani",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Requires the claim generator to copy every validated C2PA Manifest from an ingredient's Manifest Store that is not already in the asset's store, subject to the copying rules or user or configuration direction. It should also copy unvalidated manifests and unrecognised JUMBF boxes and superboxes, to stay compatible with custom assertions and future constructs.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s439-16-5-13-copying-existing-manifests",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.5.13. Copying existing manifests",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s439-16-5-13-copying-existing-manifests.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 16.5.13. Copying existing manifests\n\n<a id=\"_determining_the_need\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Heading that opens Section 16.5.13, Copying existing manifests; the block holds no text beyond the heading.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
