      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.5.15. Soft Bindings",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s448-16-5-15-soft-bindings.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### 16.5.15. Soft Bindings\n\nAn active manifest may include a C2PA Manifest as an ingredient (via a `parentOf` relationship) that was discovered using a soft binding lookup. If the Claim Generator does include such a C2PA Manifest, then it shall include a `softBindingsMatched` field indicating true, and a `softBindingAlgorithmsMatched` field containing an array of strings (of soft binding algorithm names that were used to discover the ingredient C2PA Manifest). The algorithm names shall be listed with the C2PA Soft Binding Algorithm List as identified within the `alg` field of entries in that",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Requires that when an active manifest includes as a parentOf ingredient a manifest found through a soft binding lookup, the ingredient assertion shall set softBindingsMatched to true and list in softBindingAlgorithmsMatched the algorithm names, as identified in the C2PA Soft Binding Algorithm List, used to find it.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s449-16-6-content-description-enrichment",
