      "target": "../sections/s449-16-6-content-description-enrichment.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "### 16.6. Content Description & Enrichment\n\nThese assertions carry additional information about an asset or alternative representations of its content, such as thumbnails, metadata, format-specific details, and externally stored data.\n\n<a id=\"thumbnail_assertion\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Introduces the content description and enrichment assertions, which carry extra information about an asset or alternative representations of its content, such as thumbnails, metadata, format-specific details and externally stored data.",
