    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s451-16-6-1-1-description",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.6.1.1. Description",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s451-16-6-1-1-description.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### 16.6.1.1. Description\n\nA thumbnail assertion provides an approximate visual representation of the asset at a specific event in the lifecycle of an asset. There are currently two specific events:\n\n*   ingredient import and claim creation;\n    \n*   each using a unique label for the assertion.\n    \n\n<a id=\"_claim_thumbnails\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "States that a thumbnail assertion gives an approximate visual representation of the asset at a specific lifecycle event, of which there are two, ingredient import and claim creation, each with its own label; the extracted list appears garbled, splitting this into two bullets that do not each name an event.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s452-16-6-1-1-1-claim-thumbnails",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.6.1.1.1. Claim Thumbnails",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s452-16-6-1-1-1-claim-thumbnails.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "###### 16.6.1.1.1. Claim Thumbnails\n\nFor thumbnails created at claim creation time, the thumbnail assertion shall have the label `c2pa.thumbnail.claim`. There shall be no more than one thumbnail assertion with this label in a C2PA Manifest.\n\nPrevious versions of this specification required that the IANA registry media type of the thumbnail be included in the label name (e.g., `c2pa.thumbnail.claim.png`). This naming convention has been deprecated.\n\n<a id=\"_ingredient_thumbnails\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Specifies that a thumbnail made at claim creation shall be labelled c2pa.thumbnail.claim, with at most one per manifest, and that the older convention of adding the media type to the label is deprecated.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s453-16-6-1-1-2-ingredient-thumbnails",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.6.1.1.2. Ingredient Thumbnails",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s453-16-6-1-1-2-ingredient-thumbnails.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "###### 16.6.1.1.2. Ingredient Thumbnails\n\nWhen importing an ingredient (see [Section 10.3.2.2, “Adding Ingredients”](#_adding_ingredients)), one should reference that ingredient’s own manifest-stored thumbnail. However, some ingredients may not include a thumbnail assertion, or even a manifest. In that case, a new thumbnail of the ingredient should be generated, and an ingredient thumbnail assertion created in the active manifest.\n\nAn ingredient thumbnail assertion shall have a label that starts with `c2pa.thumbnail.ingredient` and follows the [rules of assertion labels](#_multiple_instances)",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Specifies that importing an ingredient should reference its own manifest-stored thumbnail, or, where none exists, a new thumbnail should be generated and stored as an ingredient thumbnail assertion whose label shall start with c2pa.thumbnail.ingredient, follow multiple-instance rules, and be added to the ingredient's relatedAssertions. It notes that earlier conventions of media-type suffixes and a _1 suffix with a single underscore for the first instance are deprecated.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s454-16-6-1-1-3-technical-details",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "16.6.1.1.3. Technical Details",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s454-16-6-1-1-3-technical-details.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "###### 16.6.1.1.3. Technical Details\n\nA thumbnail assertion is an [embedded data assertion](#_embedded_data) but with a special label identifying this specific use case.\n\n<a id=\"alternative_content_representation_assertion\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "States that a thumbnail assertion is an embedded data assertion distinguished by a special label for this use.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
