      "target": "../sections/s504-16-9-assertion-supporting-structures.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "### 16.9. Assertion-Supporting Structures\n\nThe following structures are used by the assertions defined above rather than being assertions in their own right.\n\n<a id=\"_metadata_about_assertions\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
