      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### A.3.1. Embedding manifests into JPEG 1\n\nThe C2PA Manifest Store shall be embedded as the data contained in an **APP11** marker segment as defined in [ISO/IEC 18477-3](https://www.iso.org/standard/66071.html).\n\nSince a single marker segment in JPEG 1 cannot be larger than 64K bytes, it is likely that multiple **APP11** segments will be required, and they shall be constructed as per the JPEG 1 standard and ISO 19566-5:2023, D.2. When writing multiple segments, they shall be written in sequential order, and they shall be contiguous (i.e., one segment immediately following the next).\n\nThe sam",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "In JPEG 1 the C2PA Manifest Store shall be carried in APP11 marker segments, written as multiple sequential, contiguous segments when it exceeds the 64K segment limit, with the same method applied to Exif compressed files and, for CIPA Multi-Picture Format assets, to the APP11 segment of the first image.",
