        "text": "For SVG, the binary C2PA Manifest Store must be Base64-encoded, though an external manifest is preferred. When embedded it shall be the value of a c2pa:manifest element inside the SVG metadata element, and an xmlns:c2pa namespace declaration should be added to the svg element, as an example shows.",
