      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### A.3.6.1. C2PA Manifest Store embedding\n\nThe C2PA Manifest Store shall be embedded as a Sequencer-Specific Meta Event (`FF 7F`) placed immediately before the End of Track event (`FF 2F`) in the designated track chunk:\n\n*   For Format 0 files (single track): the sole `MTrk` chunk.\n    \n*   For Format 1 files (multi-track): the last `MTrk` chunk.\n    \n*   For Format 2 files (multiple independent patterns): the first `MTrk` chunk.\n    \n\nThe data field of the `FF 7F` event shall begin with the 3-byte C2PA extended manufacturer identifier `0x00 0x43 0x32`, immediately followed by the bytes of",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "The C2PA Manifest Store shall be embedded as an FF 7F Sequencer-Specific Meta Event placed just before the End of Track event in a designated track (the sole track for Format 0, the last for Format 1, the first for Format 2), with its data starting with the extended manufacturer identifier 0x00 0x43 0x32 followed by the store bytes. Only one such event is allowed, with duplicates meaning no manifest is treated as located, and the inserted event shall have delta-time 0 while any non-zero delta-time from the original End of Track moves to the following FF 2F event so track duration is unchanged.",
        "state": "draft",
