        "text": "In GIF the C2PA Manifest Store shall be split into data sub-blocks of at most 255 bytes inside a single Application Extension block with identifier C2PA_GIF, whose Application Authentication Code serves as a block version (initially 1.0). The block layout is given in full and the block shall be placed after the header and before the first image descriptor.",
