      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### A.3.13.1. C2PA Manifest Store embedding\n\nThe C2PA Manifest Store shall be embedded as the data of an extension block with the 4-byte ASCII type identifier `C2PA` (`0x43 0x32 0x50 0x41`). The block data is a complete C2PA Manifest Store with no additional framing or transformation.\n\n<a id=\"_locating_the_manifest_store_2\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "In these formats the C2PA Manifest Store shall be stored, without extra framing, as the data of an extension block of type C2PA.",
