    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s555-a-3-13-2-locating-the-manifest-store",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "A.3.13.2. Locating the Manifest Store",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s555-a-3-13-2-locating-the-manifest-store.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### A.3.13.2. Locating the Manifest Store\n\nTo extract the C2PA Manifest Store:\n\n1.  Read and verify the magic bytes (4 bytes).\n    \n2.  Read the metadata length _N_ (4 bytes, big-endian).\n    \n3.  Parse the JSON metadata (_N_ bytes) to obtain `media_length` (_M_).\n    \n4.  Skip the media payload (_M_ bytes).\n    \n5.  Read the extension block count (2 bytes, big-endian).\n    \n6.  Iterate extension blocks: for each, read type (4 bytes) + length _L_ (4 bytes) + data (_L_ bytes).\n    \n7.  The block with type `C2PA` contains the C2PA Manifest Store.\n    \n\n<a id=\"_data_hash_binding_2\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Extracting the manifest store involves reading the magic bytes and metadata length, parsing the JSON metadata for media_length, skipping the media payload, and iterating the extension blocks to find the one of type C2PA.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
