    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s559-a-3-14-1-c2pa-manifest-store-embedding",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "A.3.14.1. C2PA Manifest Store embedding",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s559-a-3-14-1-c2pa-manifest-store-embedding.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### A.3.14.1. C2PA Manifest Store embedding\n\nThe `value` of a `KeyValue` entry in `key_value_metadata` is a Thrift string (i.e., UTF-8 text). The C2PA Manifest Store shall therefore be Base64-encoded (per [RFC 4648](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4648)) and embedded as the `value` of a `KeyValue` entry in the `key_value_metadata` list of the footer’s `FileMetaData`, using a `key` of `c2pa:manifest`.\n\nOnly one `KeyValue` entry with a `key` of `c2pa:manifest` shall be present per file. If more than one such entry is encountered, the asset shall be treated as if no manifests were located.\n\n<",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "In Parquet the C2PA Manifest Store shall be Base64-encoded and stored as the value of a single key_value_metadata entry with key c2pa:manifest in the footer's FileMetaData, with more than one such entry meaning no manifest is treated as located.",
        "state": "draft",
