      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s560-a-3-14-2-data-hash-binding.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### A.3.14.2. Data hash binding\n\nA claim generator embedding a manifest in a Parquet file shall include a [`c2pa.hash.data`](#_data_hash) assertion with a single exclusion range covering the Base64-encoded value bytes of the `c2pa:manifest` `KeyValue` entry within the serialized footer.\n\n> **NOTE:**\n> This means that the prefix is not part of the exclusion range.\n\n<a id=\"_writing_a_manifest_store_3\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
