    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s592-a-5-1-2-syntax",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "A.5.1.2. Syntax",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s592-a-5-1-2-syntax.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### A.5.1.2. Syntax\n\n```none\naligned(8) class ContentProvenanceBoxHeader(string box_purpose) {\n    string box_purpose;\n\n    if (box_purpose == 'manifest' || box_purpose == 'original') {\n        unsigned int(64) first_merkle_aux_offset;\n    }\n}\n\naligned(8) class ContentProvenanceBox(string box_purpose) extends FullBox (\n        boxtype = 'uuid', v = 0, f = 0,\n        extended_type = 0xD8 0xFE 0xC3 0xD6 0x1B 0x0E 0x48 0x3C 0x92 0x97 0x58 0x28 0x87 0x7E 0xC4 0x81) {\n    ContentProvenanceBoxHeader(box_purpose)\n    // the remaining bytes are the ContentProvenanceBoxPayload\n}\n```\n\n`ContentProvenan",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines the syntax of ContentProvenanceBox, a 'uuid' FullBox whose header carries a box_purpose string and, for manifest or original purposes, a first_merkle_aux_offset field, with the remaining bytes forming the ContentProvenanceBoxPayload. The box_purpose values are manifest, original, update and merkle, and first_merkle_aux_offset shall give the absolute offset of the first merkle box or zero if there is none.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s593-a-5-2-box-containing-the-manifest",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "A.5.2. Box Containing the Manifest",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s593-a-5-2-box-containing-the-manifest.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### A.5.2. Box Containing the Manifest\n\nEncompassing the `box_purpose` values of `'manifest'`, `'original'`, and `'update'`. The `ContentProvenanceBoxPayload` contains the raw C2PA Manifest Store bytes followed by zero or more padding bytes. Padding bytes are not permitted outside this box unless they are contained within their own box such as a `'free'` box. When a `ContentProvenanceBox` is found with a `box_purpose` of `original` it indicates that there is another `ContentProvenanceBox` whose `box_purpose` is `update`.\n\nA `ContentProvenanceBox` with box\\_purpose set to `manifest` or `origin",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Boxes with box_purpose manifest, original or update carry the raw Manifest Store plus optional padding; manifest and original boxes shall follow 'ftyp' and sit before the first 'mdat' or 'moov' or next to 'moov', while an update box shall be the last top-level box, and update manifests are supported by renaming manifest to original without changing hash bindings. In fragmented MP4, each initialisation segment shall carry an identical manifest box for pull usage, while live push streams shall include it in at least one of every 10 initialisation segments.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s594-a-5-3-auxiliary-c2pa-boxes-for-large-and-fragmen",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "A.5.3. Auxiliary `'c2pa'` Boxes for Large and Fragmented Files",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s594-a-5-3-auxiliary-c2pa-boxes-for-large-and-fragmen.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### A.5.3. Auxiliary `'c2pa'` Boxes for Large and Fragmented Files\n\nEncompassing the `'box_purpose'` value of `'merkle'`, the `ContentProvenanceBoxPayload` contains CBOR-encoded hashes and tree proofs for Merkle tree-based validation.\n\n<a id=\"_general_19\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Merkle-purpose boxes carry CBOR-encoded hashes and tree proofs for Merkle-tree based validation.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
