      "title": "A.6.4.1. EPUB",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s614-a-6-4-1-epub.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### A.6.4.1. EPUB\n\nEPUB’s digital signatures are based on [W3C XML DigSig Core](https://www.w3.org/TR/xmldsig-core1/), where each file that is signed is listed in the `<Manifest>` element of the `<Signature>` element. In addition, no support exists for signing the ZIP Central Directory. As such, EPUB native signing shall take place before the introduction of the C2PA Manifest.\n\n<a id=\"_office_open_xml\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Because EPUB signatures follow XML DigSig and cannot sign the ZIP Central Directory, EPUB native signing shall happen before the C2PA Manifest is added.",
        "state": "draft",
