    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s623-a-8-1-general",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "A.8.1. General",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s623-a-8-1-general.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### A.8.1. General\n\nFor unstructured text where traditional file-based embedding is not practical, such as content intended for copy-paste operations across different systems, C2PA Manifests may be embedded directly into a Unicode-encoded text stream. This method uses a sequence of Unicode Variation Selectors to encode a C2PA Manifest Store in a way that is not visually rendered, ensuring that Content Credentials persist with the content itself across platforms.\n\n> **IMPORTANT:**\n> This approach should only be used with unstructured text assets where no other embedding method is feasible. It",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Manifest stores may be embedded in unstructured Unicode text, such as text meant to be copied and pasted, as a sequence of non-rendering Unicode Variation Selectors, though this method should be used only when no other embedding is feasible and remains under review.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s624-a-8-2-the-c2patextmanifestwrapper-structure",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "A.8.2. The `C2PATextManifestWrapper` Structure",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s624-a-8-2-the-c2patextmanifestwrapper-structure.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### A.8.2. The `C2PATextManifestWrapper` Structure\n\nAll unstructured text assets that wish to embed a Content Credential shall do so using Unicode variation selectors that adhere to the following syntax and semantics defined below.\n\n> **NOTE:**\n> Unicode variation selectors (U+FE00-U+FE0F and U+E0100-U+E01EF) are used because they are specifically designed to be visually non-rendering while remaining part of the valid Unicode character set.\n\n<a id=\"_definition_2\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Unstructured text assets that embed a Content Credential must do so with Unicode variation selectors following the defined C2PATextManifestWrapper syntax and semantics, chosen because they are non-rendering yet valid Unicode.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s625-a-8-2-1-definition",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "A.8.2.1. Definition",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s625-a-8-2-1-definition.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### A.8.2.1. Definition\n\n```none\nContainer Type: C2PATextManifestWrapper (contains a C2PA Manifest Store in JUMBF format)\nEncoding: Unicode Variation Selectors\nMandatory: No\nQuantity: Zero or one\n```\n\nThe `C2PATextManifestWrapper` embeds C2PA provenance into unstructured text. One such container contains a complete C2PA Manifest Store in JUMBF format.\n\n<a id=\"_syntax_3\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines the C2PATextManifestWrapper as an optional container, encoded as Unicode Variation Selectors and present zero or one time, that holds a complete C2PA Manifest Store in JUMBF format.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s626-a-8-2-2-syntax",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "A.8.2.2. Syntax",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s626-a-8-2-2-syntax.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### A.8.2.2. Syntax\n\n```none\naligned(8) class C2PATextManifestWrapper {\n    unsigned int(64) magic = 0x4332504154585400;  // \"C2PATXT\\0\"\n    unsigned int(8)  version = 1;\n    unsigned int(32) manifestLength;\n    unsigned int(8)  jumbfContainer[manifestLength];\n    unsigned int(8)  padding[];  // optional trailing padding bytes\n}\n```\n\n<a id=\"_semantics\"></a>",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Gives the binary syntax of C2PATextManifestWrapper: a 64-bit magic value \"C2PATXT\\0\", an 8-bit version of 1, a 32-bit manifestLength, the JUMBF container bytes and optional trailing padding.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s627-a-8-2-3-semantics",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "A.8.2.3. Semantics",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s627-a-8-2-3-semantics.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### A.8.2.3. Semantics\n\nmagic\n\nThe identifier for C2PA text manifests, always `C2PATXT\\0` (0x4332504154585400).\n\nversion\n\nVersion of this text embedding specification (currently 1).\n\nmanifestLength\n\nThe length in bytes of the JUMBF container, encoded as a big-endian unsigned integer.\n\njumbfContainer\n\nThe raw bytes of the C2PA Manifest Store in JUMBF format.\n\npadding\n\nZero or more bytes appended after the JUMBF container. These bytes carry no semantic meaning and shall be ignored during decoding. Padding enables deterministic wrapper byte length (see [Section A.8.5, “Deterministic Wrapper Pad",
      "truncated": true,
