      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "A.8.4.2. Detection Algorithm",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s634-a-8-4-2-detection-algorithm.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "##### A.8.4.2. Detection Algorithm\n\nA validator processing a text asset shall use the following method to identify the `C2PATextManifestWrapper`:\n\n1.  Scan the text from beginning to end for a Zero-Width No-Break Space (`U+FEFF`).\n    \n2.  For each `U+FEFF` found, check that the subsequent contiguous sequence of Unicode Variation Selectors (`U+FE00`\\-`U+FE0F`, `U+E0100`\\-`U+E01EF`) is a potential wrapper.\n    \n3.  For each potential wrapper:\n    \n    1.  Decode the first 8 variation selectors into bytes and check if they match the `magic` number `C2PATXT\\0` (0x4332504154585400).\n        \n    2",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Validators must scan text for U+FEFF markers, treat the following run of variation selectors as a candidate, check that its first eight decoded bytes match the C2PATXT\\0 magic, then parse the rest, ignoring any candidate that fails either step.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
