        "text": "Summarizes version 2.4 (April 2026) as introducing new asset format support, new assertions and the crJSON serialization, a derived JSON-LD view of a Manifest Store not intended as an input format. It lists the new repository receipt, environmental sustainability and AI disclosure assertions, HTML and structured text embedding, tighter rules for actions (such as c2pa.opened referencing its ingredient and the new relatedAssertions field), live video coverage of dynamically packaged content, moving specVersion into claim_generator_info, external reference clarifications, asset type corrections and soft binding repository routes; the extracted list repeats an empty External Reference Assertion Improvements bullet.",
