      "content": "### G.1. Index\n\n| Description | Section | File |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Claim | [Section G.2.1, “Claim”](#cddl_annex_claim) | `claim.cddl` |\n| Timestamp container | [Section G.2.2, “Timestamp Container”](#cddl_annex_tst_container) | `tstContainer.cddl` |\n| Hashed JUMBF URI | [Section G.3.1, “Hashed URI”](#cddl_annex_hashed_uri) | `hashed-uri.cddl` |\n| Hashed external URI | [Section G.3.2, “Hashed External URI”](#cddl_annex_hashed_ext_uri) | `hashed-ext-uri.cddl` |\n| Unhashed external URI | [Section G.3.3, “Unhashed External URI”](#cddl_annex_unhashed_ext_uri) | `unhashed-ext-uri.cddl` |\n| URI h",
