        "text": "An index table maps each CDDL schema to its annex section and file name. It covers core claim and timestamp schemas, URI types, hash assertions (data, BMFF, Merkle, boxes, collection, multi-asset, segment), standard assertions such as actions, ingredient, soft binding, AI disclosure and linked resource integrity, certificate status, session keys and time stamp structures, metadata and validation result types, and live media and Enhanced RTMP structures.",
