    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s714-g-2-1-claim",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "G.2.1. Claim",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s714-g-2-1-claim.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### G.2.1. Claim\n\n```cddl\n; CDDL schema for a claim map in C2PA\nclaim-map-v2 = {\n  ; uniquely identifies a specific version of an asset\n  \"instanceID\": tstr .size (1..max-tstr-length),\n\n  ; the claim generator of this claim\n  \"claim_generator_info\": generator-info-map,\n\n  ; JUMBF URI reference to the signature of this claim\n  \"signature\": jumbf-uri-type,\n  \"created_assertions\": [1* $hashed-uri-map],\n  ? \"gathered_assertions\": [1* $hashed-uri-map],\n\n  ; name of the asset (metadata assertion preferred)\n  ? \"dc:title\": tstr .size (1..max-tstr-length),\n\n  ; List of JUMBF URI references to the ass",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Gives the CDDL for claim-map-v2, which requires instanceID, claim_generator_info, signature and created_assertions and optionally carries gathered_assertions, dc:title, redacted_assertions, alg, alg_soft and the deprecated specVersion and metadata. It also defines the deprecated claim-map (with claim_generator, assertions and dc:format) and generator-info-map, which holds a required name plus optional version, icon, operating_system, specVersion and extra fields.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/c2pa-2026-specification-2-5/blocks/prose-s715-g-2-2-timestamp-container",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "G.2.2. Timestamp Container",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s715-g-2-2-timestamp-container.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### G.2.2. Timestamp Container\n\n```cddl\n; CBOR version of tstContainer and related structures based on JSON schema at\n; https://forge.etsi.org/rep/esi/x19_182_JAdES/raw/v1.1.1/19182-jsonSchema.json\ntstContainer = {\n  \"tstTokens\": [1* tstToken]\n}\n\ntstToken = {\n  \"val\": bstr\n}\n```\n\n> **NOTE:**\n> This definition is a CBOR adaptation of a subset of the schema from [JAdES](https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119100_119199/11918201/01.01.01_60/ts_11918201v010101p.pdf), section 5.3.4 and [its JSON schema](https://forge.etsi.org/rep/esi/x19_182_JAdES/raw/v1.1.1/19182-jsonSchema.json), except with th",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Gives the CDDL for tstContainer, a map whose tstTokens array holds one or more tokens, each carrying a byte string val, noting it is a CBOR adaptation of part of the JAdES schema with val as a byte string rather than Base64.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-01"
      }
    },
