      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "The CDDL defines the collection data hash map as a uris array of hashed URI entries, a required alg naming the hash algorithm applied to each entry, and an optional zip_central_directory_hash, and it also allows URN-based record identifiers (such as WARC-Record-ID) as relative URLs for containers whose members are named by URN.",
