      "target": "../sections/s731-g-5-2-action-enumeration-values.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### G.5.2. Action Enumeration Values\n\n```cddl\n; DO NOT EDIT — generated from actions.yaml\n; Run generateActions.sh to regenerate.\n; Structural definitions are in actions.cddl\n\n$action-choice /= \"c2pa.addedText\"\n$action-choice /= \"c2pa.adjustedColor\"\n$action-choice /= \"c2pa.changedSpeed\"\n$action-choice /= \"c2pa.color_adjustments\"\n$action-choice /= \"c2pa.converted\"\n$action-choice /= \"c2pa.copied\"\n$action-choice /= \"c2pa.created\"\n$action-choice /= \"c2pa.cropped\"\n$action-choice /= \"c2pa.deleted\"\n$action-choice /= \"c2pa.drawing\"\n$action-choice /= \"c2pa.dubbed\"\n$action-choice /= \"c2pa.edited\"\n$acti",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "The CDDL, generated from actions.yaml, enumerates the predefined values of $action-choice, from c2pa.addedText, c2pa.created, c2pa.edited and c2pa.redacted through c2pa.watermarked.bound and c2pa.watermarked.unbound. It also lists font-specific actions such as font.subset, font.merged and font.hinted, and allows custom actions matching a dotted, label-style pattern.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
