      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "The CDDL defines the maps, ranges and parameters for font actions, including inclusive Unicode start/stop ranges used by font.subset and the font.characters added, deleted and modified actions. It also defines the parameters for instantiating a font from a variable font, namely weight (1 to 1000, 400 being normal), width (0 to 1000 percent), italic, slant (-90 to 90 degrees), optical-size and any custom axes.",
