      "target": "../sections/s733-g-5-4-ingredient.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### G.5.4. Ingredient\n\n```cddl\n; Version 3 (v3) of the ingredient assertion\n; Assertion that describes an ingredient used in the asset\ningredient-map-v3 = {\n  ? \"dc:title\": tstr, ; name of the ingredient\n  ? \"dc:format\": format-string, ; Media Type of the ingredient\n\n  ; The relationship of this ingredient to the asset it is an ingredient of.\n  \"relationship\": $relation-choice,\n\n  ; Results from the claim generator performing full validation on the\n  ; ingredient asset. May be present whether or not `activeManifest` is\n  ; present.\n  ? \"validationResults\": validation-results-map,\n\n  ; unique",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "The CDDL defines version 3 of the ingredient assertion, ingredient-map-v3, whose only required field is relationship, alongside optional fields such as dc:title, dc:format, validationResults, instanceID, data, dataTypes, relatedAssertions, claimSignature, thumbnail, description, informationalURI, softBindingsMatched, softBindingAlgorithmsMatched and metadata. It may carry either activeManifest or digitalSourceType but not both. The block also gives the deprecated version 2 and version 1 ingredient maps, which require dc:title and dc:format and use fields such as documentID, c2pa_manifest and validationStatus, and it defines the media type format string and the relationship values parentOf, componentOf and inputTo.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
