      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "The CDDL enumerates the $model-type-choice values for AI/ML model formats, such as c2pa.types.model.onnx, c2pa.types.model.pytorch and c2pa.types.model.tensorflow. It also enumerates $asset-type-choice values such as c2pa.types.dataset, c2pa.types.generator.prompt and c2pa.types.version-history, which include all model types and allow custom label-style values.",
