      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### G.5.11. Region Role Enumeration Values\n\n```cddl\n; Enumerated values for $role-choice (used in regions-of-interest.cddl)\n; These values of role-choice are deprecated\n$role-choice /= \"c2pa.areaOfInterest\" ; arbitrary area worth identifying\n\n; this area is all that is left after a crop action\n$role-choice /= \"c2pa.cropped\"\n$role-choice /= \"c2pa.edited\" ; this area has had edits applied to it\n$role-choice /= \"c2pa.placed\" ; the area where an ingredient was placed/added\n$role-choice /= \"c2pa.redacted\" ; something in this area was redacted\n$role-choice /= \"c2pa.subjectArea\" ; area specific to a",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "The CDDL enumerates the deprecated $role-choice values for regions of interest. They include c2pa.areaOfInterest, c2pa.cropped, c2pa.edited, c2pa.placed, c2pa.redacted, c2pa.subjectArea, c2pa.deleted and c2pa.styled, plus c2pa.watermarked and c2pa.watermarked.bound for soft binding and c2pa.watermarked.unbound for watermarking without one.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
