        "text": "The CDDL defines ai-model-disclosure-map, which requires a modelType and optionally gives modelName, modelIdentifier, a contentProfile, arXiv-style scientificDomain values and metadata. The content profile can declare a humanOversightLevel of fully_autonomous, prompt_guided or human_validated to tell validators how much human involvement there was, and further fields such as modelFrontier and harmEvaluation are noted as pending future specification.",
