      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "The CDDL defines linked-resource-integrity-map, whose resources are either externalResources (hashed external URIs, for formats that only support absolute references) or relativeResources with an alg (for formats supporting references relative to the asset). An optional allURIsIncluded flag says whether every URI embedded in the container is covered, and optional metadata may be added.",
