        "text": "The CDDL defines the alternative content representation, a reference to another version of the content that is either an original preservation image or a generic representation with a label-style type and free-form parameters. The original preservation image form, typed exif.originalPreservationImage, can locate the image by a zero-based multiAssetPartIndex into a c2pa.hash.multi-asset assertion or by a hashed URI to an embedded data assertion or equivalent.",
