        "text": "The CDDL defines font-info-map, the data for the font.info assertion, which requires fullName, familyName, style, weight (a class name and a 1 to 1000 value), a constrained postScriptName, format (TrueType or OpenType) and copyrightNotice. Optional fields include version, versionUrl, releaseDate, copyrightHolder, copyrightYears, designers (each with person, foundry, contribution and start and end dates), designFoundry, sourceFoundry, identifier and metadata, and the allowed styles are Normal, Italic, Oblique, Roman and Regular.",
