        "text": "The CDDL defines the common assertion metadata map, with optional dateTime, reviewRatings, reference, a deprecated dataSource that claim generators shall not include, localizations, regionOfInterest, processStart, processEnd and custom fields, along with lower- and upper-bound time types whose timeStampType defaults to absolute. It also defines source-map (a source type and details), rating-map (a value from 1 to 5 with an optional code and explanation) and localization entries.",
