        "text": "The CDDL defines status-map, which holds a label-style code, at most one of url or resourceUrl, an optional explanation and a deprecated success flag, and status-codes-map, which groups such entries into success, informational and failure arrays. It also defines a SemVer string pattern, trust-list-uri-map, and validation-results-map, which may carry the active manifest's status codes, per-ingredient validation deltas, the specVersion used, and either a deprecated trustListUri or a trustListUris array.",
