      "target": "../sections/s760-g-8-2-verifiable-segment-info.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### G.8.2. Verifiable Segment Info\n\n```cddl\nverifiable-segment-info = COSE_Sign1_Tagged\n; The protected header contains the signature algorithm ('alg')\n; and optionally the \"claimed time of signing\" ('iat').\n; The unprotected header contains the the identifier of the session key ('kid').\n; The payload is set to the CBOR serialized `segment-info-map`.\n\nsegment-info-map = {\n    ; monotonically increasing sequence number for each segment\n    \"sequenceNumber\" => uint,\n    \"bmffHash\" => bmff-hash-map, ; C2PA c2pa.hash.bmff.v3\n    \"manifestId\" => tstr, ; shall be as described in <<manifest-identifi",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "The CDDL defines verifiable-segment-info as a COSE_Sign1 structure, with the algorithm and optional signing time in the protected header and the session key id in the unprotected header, whose payload segment-info-map holds a sequenceNumber, a bmffHash, a manifestId and an optional manifestUri.",
        "state": "draft",
